PETSELFTEST1
# V9 1A two-level play menu. First level: today, brain, move, sound, album.
# Today page and Brain page are entered and left by a long press (back to
# the first level, highlight kept), a second long press goes home. The
# voice command OPEN_GAME opens the first level again, the album card (a
# leaf) opens the album straight away. Which games "today" offers depends on
# the date, so nothing is started from it. Counted from "mark begin".
# Needs: outside the quiet hours (phase day), battery above the low level.
# expect min:PET_GAME_MENU 3
# 5 level changes: into today, back, into brain, back, into brain again.
# expect min:PET_GAME_MENU_LEVEL 5
# expect min:level=games 2
# expect min:level=top 2
# expect min:page=today 1
# expect min:page=brain 1
# expect min:game=stickers 1
# expect min:kind=album 2
# expect min:end=home 3
# expect min:name=OPEN_GAME 2
# expect min:name=GO_HOME 1
# expect none:PET_GAME_REFUSED 0
# expect none:PET_CARE_RECORD 0
# expect none:PET_SLEEP_REQUESTED 0
# expect none:PET_SELFTEST_ABORT 0
# expect selftest_done 1
# expect max_partial_ms 2500
# expect max_full_ms 5000
phase day
volume 15
waitidle 60000
pet
wait 6000
# Normalize restored pet state to "home, neutral".
tap press 6000
hold press 1500 6000
mark begin
# Rail Story(1) -> Game(2), press: first level (full refresh).
tap down 2500
tap press 6000
# Today page (card 0), a highlight move inside it, back, highlight kept.
tap press 3000
tap down 600
hold press 1500 3000
# Brain page (card 1), a few moves, back.
tap down 600
tap press 3000
tap down 600
tap down 600
hold press 1500 3000
# Long press on the first level goes home (full refresh).
hold press 1500 8000
# Voice opens the first level too; leave it by a long press.
vcmd OPEN_GAME
wait 6000
hold press 1500 8000
# Voice GO_HOME from the second level goes home at once, not up one level.
vcmd OPEN_GAME
wait 6000
tap down 600
tap press 3000
vcmd GO_HOME
wait 6000
# Album: the fifth card, a leaf. Press opens it, press again is home.
tap press 6000
tap down 600
tap down 600
tap down 600
tap down 600
tap press 6000
tap press 8000
pet
wait 5000
end
